<function name="IS_XCF">
<retval/>
<param name="archive" type="STRING"> Name of an archive </param>
<abstract> It returns 1 if the archive is an image in XCF format </abstract>
<description>
    <p>
	This function checks the format of an image in disk and returns
	1 if the image is in XCF format or 0 in opposite case.
    </p>
</description>
